# Whitelist: ignore everything, then explicitly un-ignore only the files
# that belong in the Apps Script project. Every .gs file shares one global
# scope in Apps Script, so the sibling folders in this directory (the old
# pre-plan draft, the preserved Gemini submission, dev tooling, and tests)
# must never be pushed alongside these — they declare colliding globals
# (doGet, SCHEMA, CONFIG) and, for dev/tests, are not meant to run as
# server-side Apps Script code at all.
#
# clasp is not installed in this project; this file is prepared for if/when
# the user chooses to install and use it themselves. No push has occurred.
**/**

!appsscript.json
!Code.gs
!Database.gs
!Tasks.gs
!Calendar.gs
!Jobs.gs
!JobSource_JSearch.gs
!JobFilters.gs
!JobDedupe.gs
!Discovery.gs
# Phase 5 M1: Staged for deployment alongside Milestone 2 static-checks allowlist updates:
# !Applications.gs
!Index.html
!Styles.html
!JavaScript.html
